# Stack & domain locks

## Stack

- pnpm monorepo: `apps/web` (Next.js 15) + `apps/api` (NestJS 11)
- PostgreSQL (Supabase) + Prisma 6 in `packages/db`
- Clerk auth on web; API verifies JWT via `@clerk/backend`
- Domain mutations via NestJS REST `/v1` — not Server Actions
- Shared DTOs/permissions in `packages/shared`
- No Convex; no Prisma or direct DB access in web

## Domain invariants

- One active allotment per bed and per resident (enforce in transactions + DB)
- Every domain write: role guard + `hostelId` scope
- Audit sensitive mutations (`membership`, allotment, payments)
- Amounts: integer paise — never `float` / `number` for money

## UI

- Use existing shell / `DataTable` / `EmptyState` / `Button` / field primitives
- Status tones via `StatusPill` only — semantic, not decorative
